    {"type": "text", "id": "refs-list", "x": 60, "y": 648, "width": 300, "height": 200,
     "text": "workflow.md           开工流程\nelement-format.md     元素格式\ndrawlib-catalog.md    组件库清单\nprototype-workflow    原型工作流\narchitecture-workflow 架构工作流\nanimation-pipeline    动画帧模型\nanimation-best-prac   节奏/easing\nlayout-system.md      网格/对齐\ncolor-system.md       配色纪律\nanti-slop.md          反 slop 清单\naudio-design-rules    BGM/SFX\nverification.md       验证清单\narch-lint.md          布局/lint\ncritique-guide.md     评审打分", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3,
